# Offline formula rendering assets for the Geany Markdown plugin.
#
# mathjax/  - MathJax 3.2.2 (Apache-2.0), tex-chtml-full.js includes the
#             ams, physics and mhchem TeX extensions plus CHTML fonts.
# katex/    - KaTeX 0.18.7 (MIT), core + mhchem + auto-render extensions
#             and fonts.
#
# Both engines are bundled so the preview works fully offline; the plugin
# loads them via absolute file:// URIs (see src/math.c).
#
# Versions match the npm releases vendored on 2026-09-23:
#   https://registry.npmjs.org/mathjax/-/mathjax-3.2.2.tgz
#   https://registry.npmjs.org/katex/-/katex-0.18.7.tgz
